{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "c2af69950d6684433208e5ff67750760ca85cbea12202acbfd1f762afdef7db7", "ja": "妖精たちの特訓", "zh": "妖精们的特训", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7fd770c3b95c1e0a72382295de67b811ab2306ee857695e54a0fb8e914437c9c", "ja": "公園でダンス練習をする志保の元に、一緒に\n練習しようと、桃子、ロコ、歩が訪れる。\n歩達に自分の担当曲を練習させるわけに\nいかないと一時は断る志保だったが、歩の\n申し出で、全員順番に教わることになる。", "zh": "桃子、ROCO和步来到了在公园练习舞蹈的志保\n身边，打算一起练习。虽然志保表示不能麻烦\n步等人也练习自己负责的歌曲而拒绝，但因为\n步的提议，而决定依序接受大家的指导。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bb7a1c9160e92d091a1c4578a53f25334600bf7a7680b0a1aa8868dd141107f2", "ja": "（チラシ配りの成果か、Fairyチームの公演は\n世間でも噂になり始めた）", "zh": "（也许是发传单的成果，\n大众也开始讨论Fairy队的公演了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1f31e4677c0d7dccebab91be7080acb6afed9321e1afc32912511dfef408f063", "ja": "（いい流れだな。プレッシャーもあるが、\n俺も早く戻って……、ん？）", "zh": "（事情发展得很顺利呢，虽然也有点压力，\n我也要快点回去……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "dad966ceadfea66efdb345f322236a5e860c8aa756851693dfbe9df6dd68b1dc", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ、はぁ……！\nふぅ……。", "zh": "呼、呼、呼……！\n呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1003_p", "source_sha256": "43f07f387b7cf67a7259321da752df5ee9600a702d206ad97cbff88d530a307b", "ja": "志保？　なんでこんなところに……。\nダンスの練習か？", "zh": "志保？你怎么在这里……\n练习舞蹈吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "3cd594adcb0623a09b3d2dd84b9988d9059b8eb6c5811fce81ffdc2186682286", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nはい、今日のおさらいをしてました。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n是的，我在复习今天练的舞步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "52b99147051e1f2a499a8f72c80dd370386eb6135e3ebe6f940802e7abe7194d", "ja": "レッスンルームでやりたかったんですけど、\nちょうど使われていたので。", "zh": "本来想在练习室练，\n但正好有人在使用。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e4019673674e0debc7b6793bfeef951532a5a43f1598189480a8dd4b68d7088b", "ja": "そうか、熱心で何よりだ。練習してたのは、\n新曲の振り付けみたいだけど、調子はどうだ？", "zh": "这样啊，这么勤奋练习真是再好不过了。\n看来你在练习的是新歌的舞步，状况怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "7623da1f5bd5c31d49e5b37fc94f1c1715266d595b626dfaf75d47205f150ddf", "ja": "調子ですか。まあ……\nまだまだですから、悪いんだと思います。", "zh": "状况吗？嗯……\n因为还有待加强，我认为不太好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b6291e02cfcfbcda22ffe840f381047bd7042d39a0bb400a36985884fda4988e", "ja": "な、なるほど。", "zh": "原、原来如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "0b3ff779960d960aaa656aadac649e33a35a943f6b3f1d86fe9690e9eae15a96", "ja": "でも、まだ時間はありますし。\n本番には間に合うよう頑張ります。", "zh": "但也还有时间，\n我会努力赶上正式演出的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "9f6ac6fbaa036bf83bf3aa505833a0e910ca76dd6fe724ceec560e8aaacf3ba3", "ja": "用はそれだけですか？\nそれじゃあ、私は練習に……。", "zh": "你找我就是为了这个吗？\n那我就回去练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1011_025roc", "source_sha256": "c2ec8bc343acd78ecde6ea24e0c0fb9e6aa91f2ed66b1dc75c2db9e29fc6edbd", "ja": "モモコ、離してください～！\nロコには、まだセットのブラッシュアップがぁ～！", "zh": "桃子，请你放手～！\nROCO还有Set的Brush up要做～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "aac33d5b7a8869e9deedee6c3aa9580a76f6dd25cb96ea9f36f1d18974dc7bf9", "ja": "ダメだよ！\nロコさん、まだ振り付けを全部覚えてないでしょ？", "zh": "不行啦！\nROCO姊，你还没把舞步全都记起来吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1013_p", "source_sha256": "edd8ac2206bebb9b81f875e88873a09e596f273c8e444a47837895141dc78209", "ja": "桃子とロコじゃないか。\nもしかして、ここへ練習しに来たのか？", "zh": "这不是桃子和ROCO吗？\n你们该不会是来这里练习的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "d00d6129e08ddcc4379226543c7b353591a76532df4aaa1a77809b260cad9a8c", "ja": "あ、お兄ちゃんと志保さんもいたんだ。\nそう、Fairy公演に向けて練習しにきたの。", "zh": "啊，大哥哥和志保姊也在呀。\n对，我们是为了Fairy公演来练习的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "a4cb5c80303f3d4ed6404a67108d202d83a754d56431054eda2b94b2eed235be", "ja": "桃子たちはプロだからね。\nちゃんとできないまま舞台に立つわけにはいかないよ。", "zh": "因为桃子我们是专业的嘛。\n没有练好可不能站上舞台喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1016_025roc", "source_sha256": "b3b6a339324ba7c3b3787753bfd40847f38970266fdc11970c5e34dfe149c7ab", "ja": "う～……今ダンスをしたら、ロコの頭の中にある\nホットなアイディアが……。", "zh": "呜……刚刚跳了舞之后，\nROCO脑中Hot的Idea就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "715926c871c4bf4e45477d619fb4a656e37d96c19af6f68744ff7e9ea8596cb1", "ja": "志保さんも、ここで振り付けの練習してたんでしょ？\nちょうどいいから、一緒にやろうよ。", "zh": "志保姊也在这里练习舞步对吧？\n正好，就一起练习吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "f11235aea612cbeb348a5b3eaab52e8b3158c6d4d0658c65465ea3801aa1dc0e", "ja": "え？　でも、私……。", "zh": "咦？可是我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a865fe7fbf1456bfb933150083ad2a0bc8873cd437109ea594bcc78b69fc9d57", "ja": "ちょっと待ったー！", "zh": "等一下──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1020_034ayu", "source_sha256": "48b6f5c2f037c81f07cc1fb57c8b96cf1c506baf7a5e357caa2d42fad80ff45b", "ja": "ダンスのことなら、アタシに任せな！", "zh": "舞蹈的问题就交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1021_049mom", "source_sha256": "ab2501bba97f0a7a633ac888310c88cca5992e89edf9e169824b3ab6a62ad7d6", "ja": "あれ。歩さんも練習しにきたの？", "zh": "咦？步姊也来练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1022_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4622fd8e4498ce606db948852e874ad4e497026ccf0dfeb240c600e5f66e557e", "ja": "いやぁ、劇場の窓から、\n志保がここで練習してるのが見えたんだ！", "zh": "不是啦，我是从剧场的窗户\n看见志保在这里练习！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bb813d5242b7723319b99e8277934bd6427e46a9dedadb81ab3dcf1194f38a28", "ja": "ずーっと頑張ってるの見てたら、なんか、\nほっとけなくなってさ。アタシも混ざっていいだろ？", "zh": "看你一直那么努力，总觉得\n很放不下心，我也可以加入吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "f2682cf13075ae2afc042878ab5d1c6fad4fe910a27a6b25dce27fa40aa9fa4c", "ja": "気持ちはありがたいんですけど……。", "zh": "我很感谢你的心意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1025_033sih", "source_sha256": "74a375dfe19f65eed36742d95be6b9ad20c0aeef1c5e167c07a1b70adbb463af", "ja": "今練習してるのは、オープニングの\n新曲の振り付けなんです。", "zh": "但我现在在练习的是\n开场新歌的舞步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1026_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e00d776d7b611d99856bbcbb3709ab3b612fb97a5ba78b33fa32191a54ad55e1", "ja": "大丈夫！　アタシ、新曲のダンスもばっちり\n覚えてるから、何でも聞いて！", "zh": "没问题！我把新歌的舞步也都记得很清楚，\n尽管问吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1027_033sih", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1028_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1e6e549cfd19bf1a5eab2bf7cdf44f9c609c9ce325b2ed50071eba59eb622cd9", "ja": "もちろん、ロコと桃子の曲もね！\nあとで一緒にやってみよっか♪", "zh": "当然，ROCO和桃子的歌也是！\n等下一起跳跳看吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1029_049mom", "source_sha256": "687d60f3c6df13faf358c0049fc93a8ff548a9aa03f52d0d5f3ec7904dae81d5", "ja": "すごいね、歩さん。桃子たちは、\n自分のダンスだけでせいいっぱいなのに。", "zh": "步姊真厉害呢，桃子我们光是\n练习自己的舞蹈就快应付不来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1030_025roc", "source_sha256": "e20dfaa39f1f83e1ae99f8fd293d40cfbc109b8f35e8dd6c9ba5ae4ec4d2a491", "ja": "ロコも、セットのブラッシュアップだけで\nタイムアップしてました……。アユム、グレイトです！", "zh": "ROCO也是，光是Set的Brush up\n就Time up了……步，Great！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1031_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d1616937fc8ed490f8d83ddcc2f94fa44d06ee44143b5463dd9aa57302cc0be4", "ja": "へへっ、公演の課題はダンスだって言ったじゃん！\nアタシ、みんなで最高のダンスを見せたくてさ～。", "zh": "嘿嘿，就说公演的课题是舞蹈吧！\n我想跟大家一起展现最精彩的舞蹈～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1032_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e73c54b6a1cef18cdd23d9664453872b6f2aa0e6432b152bafcf88a1f3646732", "ja": "だからみんなのダンス、アタシに磨かせてよ！\n別に感謝しなくていいからさ♪", "zh": "所以就让我来训练大家跳舞吧！\n不用感谢我也没关系喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1033_033sih", "source_sha256": "699aa54f7f51b1312300cd035091b91d6134d737ba0cb337b7056af920f935d2", "ja": "歩さん……。", "zh": "步姊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1034_049mom", "source_sha256": "30026e1d62317a3e96a7b6ebbf76ce03da7b6f0b658ae75cc49b573956523f5d", "ja": "じゃあ順番に教わろうよ。最初は志保さんの曲。\n桃子とロコさんは、バックダンサー役ね。", "zh": "那就照顺序教吧，首先是志保姊的歌。\n桃子和ROCO姊来伴舞吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1035_025roc", "source_sha256": "29640295b52ec2408dbf9aab2c481fd855031aba81176a856643deec1bf8f0ac", "ja": "わかりました！\nロコは、シホの周りをワンダリングします！", "zh": "知道了！\nROCO会在志保的周围Wandering！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1036_025roc", "source_sha256": "b4444d7a843f270bb810b7df6641116cf08bc904ac3aaed1567eef76a8befb3d", "ja": "ステージアートは、ひとりではクリエイトできません。\nみんなでクリエイトするものですから！", "zh": "Stage Art没办法一个人Create。\n因为要由大家一起Create！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1038_p", "source_sha256": "e4f57d8b966f9dead6f32e65687506d799e1eaa88703246432fca22c4e6e2093", "ja": "いいアイディアだな。きっと桃子たちのためにもなると\n思う。違う曲の振り付けでも、共通の動きは多いから。", "zh": "真是好点子，我想这对桃子她们一定也很有帮助。\n就算是不同歌曲的舞步，也有很多共通的动作嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1039_p", "source_sha256": "34e41eb874d2ee7748f6994d2801b1932c30bfc6a2d78682a926f0f6ee0dce7d", "ja": "志保、素直にお願いしたらどうだ？", "zh": "志保，你就坦白一点，拜托步教你吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1040_033sih", "source_sha256": "7cb79ec461e224198b98c9dcf6a07378d5fa97e417e6885c320e5d10f305d132", "ja": "本当に、迷惑じゃなければ……。\n歩さん、よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "如果真的不会给你添麻烦的话……\n步姊，请多指教。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1041_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a713cfac82fb415fe35e8f5397acbc84c6366a1212783830bad1c7b215d05fcb", "ja": "オッケー！　そうこなくっちゃなっ！\nそれじゃあ早速……レッツ・ダンシング！", "zh": "OK！就是要这样才行！\n那么赶快……Let's dancing！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1042_p", "source_sha256": "499442a837ec1aed97b4e18f467917a83f1be6f48ee075c54abea47fa44ab3bc", "ja": "（それぞれの目標が収束して、ひとつに……。\nみんなで作り上げる公演、どうなるか楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（每个偶像的目标合而为一……\n真期待大家会共同打造出怎么样的公演！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1043_033sih", "source_sha256": "bc9155aaa1068b4fe2c610f44cb47e38a8382041c216363fb0a88824a60098ce", "ja": "……桃子、後で桃子達の振り付けも教えてもらえる？\nさわりだけしか覚えられないけど。", "zh": "……桃子，等一下可以也教我你们的舞步吗？\n我只记得开头而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1044_033sih", "source_sha256": "ba44efe1129d72753c064f3978206bd211b72912f895b23a711ad22ba8a11015", "ja": "それから……ロコさん。\nセット作り、後で手伝います。", "zh": "还有……ROCO。\n结束后我帮你一起做布置。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_04_1045_025roc", "source_sha256": "d25df85bea7f7ed74527bc5525d5de90a57d75b94623a7c78233b41193a64884", "ja": "！　ホントですか！？\nシホ、サンクスです～！", "zh": "真的吗！？\n志保，Thanks～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
